# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Mutige plakative Geometrie: Ultramarin, Senfgelb, Rostrot und kantige Farbflächen."
msgstr "Bold graphic geometry: ultramarine, mustard yellow, rust red and sharply cut color planes."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "BERGSPORT"
msgstr "MOUNTAIN SPORTS"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
