msgstr "FROM TOWN HALL"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Akustische Berggefühle für den ganzen Skitag."
msgstr "Acoustic mountain music for the whole ski day."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Ruhe hinter dem letzten Gipfel — ganz ohne Hektik."
msgstr "Peace beyond the last summit — without a rush."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Wolken, Schnee und tiefe Meditation."
msgstr "Clouds, snow and deep meditation."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Tanz zwischen Sternen und Gletscherlicht."
msgstr "Dance among stars and glacier light."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Warme Lo-Fi-Momente am Kamin."
msgstr "Warm lo-fi moments by the fireplace."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Ein Sonnenaufgang für jeden Bergmenschen."
msgstr "A sunrise for every mountain lover."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Nur in der Hotelverwaltung: Piano und Lounge."
msgstr "Piano and lounge music, exclusively in hotel management."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Alpengefühl im traditionellen Radiofenster."
msgstr "Alpine charm on a traditional radio channel."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Nordische Momente für weite Winterlandschaften."
msgstr "Nordic moments for endless winter landscapes."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Gitarrenpower für den Snowpark."
msgstr "Guitar power for the snowpark."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Das eigene Ska-Album — SoundCloud erst nach Klick."
msgstr "The creator's ska album — SoundCloud opens only on demand."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "KoSch-Originalalbum — SoundCloud erst nach Klick."
msgstr "KoSch's original album — SoundCloud opens only on demand."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Die Redaktion · Tag %d"
msgstr "The Editors · Day %d"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "%s · %d Abfahrten · %d Gäste insgesamt"
msgstr "%s · %d runs · %d guests in total"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Ein Klang für deinen Bergurlaub."
msgstr "A soundtrack for your mountain holiday."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Android Preview"
msgstr "Android Preview"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Der Stadtschreiber öffnete erstmals das Tor zur Android-Bergwelt. Noch war SkiZones ein kleines Experiment, aber der Grundstein war gelegt."
msgstr "The town clerk opened the gates to our first Android mountain world. SkiZones was still an experiment, but its foundation was laid."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Alpen und Karriere"
msgstr "Alps and Careers"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Der Gemeinderat beschloss die ersten Karrieren. Alpenlandschaft, Wirtschaft und Bauverwaltung erhielten eine gemeinsame Spielordnung."
msgstr "The municipal council created the first careers. Alpine landscapes, finances and construction entered one shared game world."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Auf den ersten Pisten tauchten Spuren im Schnee auf. Die Bürger erzählten erstmals vom gelebten Winterbetrieb."
msgstr "The first pistes began to carry tracks in the snow. Our citizens started to tell stories about mountain life."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Dein Verlauf entscheidet"
msgstr "Your Route Matters"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Das Bauamt lernt, dass jeder gesetzte Streckenpunkt zählt: Der Verlauf sollte fortan tatsächlich den Weg bestimmen."
msgstr "The planning office learned that every waypoint matters: the route must match the path the player draws."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Lifte und Stationsplätze"
msgstr "Lifts and Station Plazas"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Die Liftaufsicht bezog die Stationsplätze. Damit wurden Aufstieg, Kapazität und Zugang zu einer echten Planungsfrage."
msgstr "Lift operations moved into their first station plazas. Boarding, capacity and access became serious planning decisions."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Bauen und Bergleben"
msgstr "Construction and Mountain Life"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Neue Gebäude brachten Leben zwischen die Abfahrten; das Skigebiet wuchs zum bewohnten Bergdorf."
msgstr "New buildings filled the spaces between pistes. The ski area began to grow into an inhabited Alpine village."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Flüssiger Betrieb und dein eigener Resortstil"
msgstr "Smoother Operations and Your Resort Style"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Die Gemeinde konnte ihren eigenen Stil wählen, während die Betriebe flüssiger durch den Tag arbeiteten."
msgstr "Each municipality could choose its own appearance while everyday business ran more smoothly."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Ein Skitag geht wirklich zu Ende"
msgstr "A Ski Day Really Ends"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Der erste vollständig geregelte Skitag endete. Von nun an gehörten Abend, Nacht und neuer Morgen zum Dorfkalender."
msgstr "Our first fully managed ski day ended. Evening, night and a new morning joined the town calendar."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Wege, Schwung und Gegenanstiege"
msgstr "Paths, Turns and Uphill Sections"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Neue Wege, Gegenanstiege und Skischwünge brachten mehr Bewegungsfreiheit in die Schneeordnung."
msgstr "New paths, uphill sections and ski turns gave visitors greater freedom across the snow."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Eine kleine Winterwelt und verlässlich weiterspielen"
msgstr "A Small Winter World, Reliable Progress"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Der Stadtrat stellte die Sicherung der Fortschritte in den Mittelpunkt: Lieber eine kleinere Welt als verlorene Karrieren."
msgstr "The council put progress protection first: a smaller world was better than a lost career."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Besser planen, echte Bedürfnisse, Deutsch und Englisch"
msgstr "Better Planning, Real Needs, Two Languages"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Zweisprachige Schilder und echte Bedürfnisse öffneten die Gemeinde für neue Gäste und Spielweisen."
msgstr "Bilingual signs and real needs welcomed new guests and new ways to play."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Präzise klicken, Breite wählen, Kurven glätten"
msgstr "Precise Taps, Widths and Smooth Curves"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Das Tiefbauamt erlaubte präzisere Fingerpositionen, Pistenbreiten und weichere Kurven."
msgstr "Civil engineering improved touch precision, piste widths and smooth curves."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Alpine Villages & Eight Resorts"
msgstr "Alpine Villages and Eight Resorts"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Acht Fantasieorte und alpine Promenaden wurden verbunden. Die Bergregion bekam erstmals ein größeres Ortsbild."
msgstr "Eight fictional areas and Alpine promenades connected the mountain region into a wider village landscape."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Real Resorts & 24h Operations"
msgstr "Real Resorts and 24-Hour Operations"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Die ersten vier realen Resort-Szenarien und ganztägige Betriebe wurden zum Gegenstand unserer Stadtplanung."
msgstr "Our first four real-resort scenarios and round-the-clock businesses entered the town planning agenda."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Das Rathaus bestätigte die neue Szenario- und Betriebsstruktur als frühen Ausbau des Gemeinwesens."
msgstr "The council formally adopted the new scenario and operations structure as an early municipal expansion."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Pistenpunkte und echte Anschlüsse"
msgstr "Piste Points and Proper Junctions"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Der Wegebau erhielt stabile Anschlussregeln; überlappende Strecken sollten nicht länger die Talstation verunstalten."
msgstr "Path construction received stable connection rules; overlapping routes could no longer spoil the valley station."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Die Baukommission erlaubte versetzbare Pistenpunkte und saubere Verbindungen zwischen Abschnitten."
msgstr "Our planning commission approved movable piste points and smooth connections between sections."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Stabile Karte, klare Missionen und direkte Liftteams"
msgstr "Stable Maps, Clear Missions and Lift Teams"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Missionskarten, direkte Mitarbeiterteams und stabilisierte Karten machten die Verwaltung übersichtlicher."
msgstr "Mission cards, direct staff assignments and stable maps made the municipality easier to manage."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Gäste mit eigenen Urlaubswünschen"
msgstr "Guests With Individual Vacation Wishes"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Gäste bekamen eigene Wünsche und unterschiedliche Wege durch das Dorf; unser Fremdenverkehrsamt musste mitdenken."
msgstr "Guests gained personal wishes and varied routes through town; our visitor office had to adapt."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Vier Karrieren, Updates und eigene Wege"
msgstr "Four Careers, Updates and Custom Paths"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Vier unabhängige Karrieren wurden eingerichtet, dazu Updatekontrollen und selbstgeplante Fußwege."
msgstr "Four independent career slots opened, together with update checks and player-built walkways."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Anlagen direkt verwalten und leichter anschließen"
msgstr "Manage Facilities and Connect Them More Easily"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Werkstätten, Liftstationen und Betriebsräume wurden vom Gebäude aus direkt verwaltbar."
msgstr "Workshops, lift stations and operating rooms became manageable directly from their buildings."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "PMDD-Winterbranding und vollflächiger Ladebildschirm"
msgstr "PMDD Winter Identity and Fullscreen Loading"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Ein neuer winterlicher Auftritt mit PMDD-Ladebild und App-Zeichen wurde auf dem Rathausplatz enthüllt."
msgstr "The town square celebrated a new winter identity, PMDD loading art and app icon."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "kompakte Skiorte, mehrtägige Hotelgäste und fließender Pistenverkehr"
msgstr "Compact Ski Towns, Multi-Day Guests and Smooth Traffic"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Kleine Skiorte, tatsächliche Übernachtungen und ein fließender Pistenverkehr machten das Dorf zum Ferienort."
msgstr "Small ski towns, genuine overnight stays and smooth piste traffic turned our village into a holiday destination."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Hauptspiel vor Szenarien"
msgstr "Main Game Before Scenarios"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Im Rathausprotokoll steht: Zuerst gehört die Bühne dem Hauptspiel; Szenarien bleiben zusätzliche Abenteuer."
msgstr "The town records declare: the main game comes first, while scenarios remain optional adventures."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Bergwelt, Spielgefühl und fünf Bildstile"
msgstr "Mountain World, Atmosphere and Five Visual Styles"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Fünf gestalterische Handschriften gaben dem Ort unterschiedliche Lichtstimmungen und Oberflächen."
msgstr "Five visual identities brought distinct lighting and surfaces to our Alpine communities."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Lebendige Pisten, kreative Bergwelten und 1.000 Erfolge"
msgstr "Live Pistes, Creative Worlds and 1,000 Achievements"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Tausend erreichbare Erfolge, fünfhundert Ränge und lebendigere Pisten wurden ins Gemeindealbum aufgenommen."
msgstr "One thousand achievements, five hundred mastery ranks and more lively pistes entered the town archive."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Landschaft, Pistenwerkstatt und freiere Dorfplanung"
msgstr "Landscape, Piste Workshop and Freer Village Planning"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Neue Landschaftsdetails, freieres Bauen und eine Pistenwerkstatt verbesserten das Gelände und das Handwerk."
msgstr "New scenery details, freer construction and a piste workshop improved the terrain and craftsmanship."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Hotel-Mikrowelten und sechs neue Landschaftsdetails"
msgstr "Hotel Micro-Worlds and Six New Scenery Details"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Häuser erhielten kleine eigene Geschichten; sechs neue Landschaftsminiaturen verschönerten die Wege."
msgstr "Buildings gained their own stories, and six new miniature scenery features brightened the streets."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Lineare Hotelmodule und wiederkehrende Winterfeste"
msgstr "Linear Hotel Modules and Annual Winter Festivals"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Hotels wurden zu Ketten mit Modulen, und der jährliche Advents- und Silvesterkalender fand seinen Platz."
msgstr "Hotels became chains of modules; annual Advent and New Year celebrations took their place on the calendar."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Alpine Radio, Crewleben und illustrierter Pistenatlas"
msgstr "Alpine Radio, Crew Life and Illustrated Piste Atlas"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Das alpine Radio, die Crew und illustrierte Pistenkarten brachten Klang und Orientierung in jeden Ort."
msgstr "Alpine Radio, staff routines and illustrated piste maps brought sound and orientation to each town."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Nahtlose Alpine-Radio-Klangwelt (erste Iteration)"
msgstr "Seamless Alpine Radio — First Iteration"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Die Musik durfte sanfter von Titel zu Titel reisen; gleichzeitig wurde die unerwünschte grelle FX-Klangquelle stillgelegt."
msgstr "Music began to flow more smoothly between songs; the unwanted shrill synthetic FX source was silenced."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Bauakte 0.30: Spielstand-Hotfix, Radio, Hotel-Lounge und mobile Darstellung sind integriert. Erst nach erfolgreicher Android-Freigabe gilt v0.30.0 als veröffentlicht."
msgstr "Municipal record 0.30: save recovery, radio, hotel lounge and mobile UI are integrated. Version 0.30.0 counts as released only after successful Android approval."

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "I · Künstlerische Dorferneuerung"
msgstr "I · Artistic Village Renewal"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Zeitungsdruck mit echter Doppelseite, typografischer Hierarchie und stilabhängigen Radiowerbungen"
msgstr "Newspaper printing with a proper double-page layout, clear typographic hierarchy and theme-aware radio advertisements"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Drei neue Bildstile: Neon Noir, Aurora Ink und Bauhaus"
msgstr "Three new art themes: Neon Noir, Aurora Ink and Bauhaus"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Rathaus-Chronik, überarbeitete Dorf-Ausstattung und saisonale Werbekästen"
msgstr "Town Hall archive, improved village details and seasonal advertisement displays"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Alte Spielstände 0.19–0.30 unverändert öffnen; Gebäudemenüs auf kleinen Displays prüfen"
msgstr "Keep saved games from 0.19 to 0.30 readable; verify building menus on small displays"

# SkiZones 0.31 — artistic Town Hall and newspaper
msgid "Godot-Szenentests, Android-Screenshotvergleich, unveränderte Bestandskarrieren"
